---
import PillarLayout from '../../layouts/PillarLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<PillarLayout slug="water-heaters">

  <section class="section bg-sand-2" style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow"><Icon name="droplet" size={15} /> From diagnosis to hot water, fast</span>
      <h2>The right unit, sized to how you actually live</h2>
      <div class="pillar-detail__body">
        <p>A water heater that has let go is usually an emergency, and we keep the path from the call to the replacement short. We will tell you honestly whether a part fixes it or a replacement is the better call, and we size a new tank or tankless unit to how your household actually uses hot water, not to a generic number.</p>
        <p>Tankless water heaters are popular for the endless hot water and the wall-space saving, and they are not all the same. We size the unit to your peak demand so the shower stays hot when the dishwasher runs, and we service the units we install. Many units qualify for our Vista Credit rental and finance program.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PillarLayout>
